meta {
  name: Update Radiology Test Template
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/siteadmin/radiology-tests/{{siteAdminRadiologyTestId}}
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{siteAdminToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "testDisplayName": "CT Chest (revised)",
    "isContrast": true,
    "priceMsrp": 4800,
    "priceMaximum": 4500,
    "isActive": true
  }
}

docs {
  Update a SITE_ADMIN radiology-test template. Auth: SiteAdmin token, requires
  `master-data:write`. Partial update of the flat scalar fields — omitted fields
  are left unchanged.

  Classification refs stay NULL (templates can't reference tenant catalogue).
  Conflicts/cross-field rules match Create Radiology Test Template
  (`RADIOLOGY_TEST_NAME_CONFLICT` / `RADIOLOGY_TEST_CODE_CONFLICT` on clash;
  price ordering 422). 404 `RADIOLOGY_TEST_NOT_FOUND` if the id isn't a live
  template.
}
